Topic: {{ $json.topic }}
Brand: {{ $json.brand }}
Writing Style: {{ $json.styleName }}
Language: {{ $json.language }}

{% if $json.userKeywords and $json.userKeywords != '' %}
The user has provided these keywords — use them as the base:
User Keywords: {{ $json.userKeywords }}
Set the first user-provided keyword as primaryKeyword. Distribute the rest as secondaryKeywords. Add more LSI keywords to complete the set.
{% else %}
No keywords provided — generate them based on the topic and style.
{% endif %}

{% if $json.refAnalysis and $json.refAnalysis.topKeywords %}
Also consider blending these keywords found on the reference website:
Reference Site Keywords: {{ $json.refAnalysis.topKeywords }}
{% endif %}

Keyword Strategy:
{{ $json.keywordStrategy }}

Return ONLY valid JSON. No markdown. No explanation:
{
  "primaryKeyword": "exact main keyword phrase",
  "secondaryKeywords": ["kw2", "kw3", "kw4", "kw5", "kw6"],
  "lsiKeywords": ["lsi1", "lsi2", "lsi3", "lsi4"],
  "metaTitle": "SEO title under 60 characters",
  "metaDescription": "compelling meta description under 160 characters in the {{ $json.styleName }} voice",
  "suggestedH2s": ["H2 heading 1", "H2 heading 2", "H2 heading 3", "H2 heading 4", "H2 heading 5"],
  "hookQuestion": "compelling opening question for the intro",
  "tipBoxText": "short practical tip for the tip box"
}

